RPMB digests computed in the program.

The RPMB commands authenticate each frame with HMAC-SHA256 under the
device's key and derive nonces from MD5; upstream asks the kernel's crypto
socket interface (AF_ALG) for both.  LikeOS has no such interface, so
create_hash() computes them with likeos-hash.c from this port directory
(standard SHA-256, HMAC and MD5).  Same inputs, same outputs, same
allocation contract for the callers.

